8ilCmBkqcVch8o54RD9LFhgpGvIVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAbPoPFDRUzkjHFPlnAtr9ixn2kQtfULQ_Uszx5aw0W-g&oe=6A6892C0"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-104346.png", "id": "1910051799596938", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1910051802930271_5093697632380196663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jgNJZ4wKauUQ7kNvwE2Ktvb&_nc_oc=AdoR67iZTaejMAUzxGJAEzzgoIyp_1wjVTqqYTTW-ozNHjSPHLY2TIOaLzg3NZsbVGg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAavD4bi6N0iydyXLhpPgnjXPAowxUyu3FeFfjHydjGsQ&oe=6A68A61B"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-103557.png", "id": "1406115264546505", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1406115267879838_2631368577935749496_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GofBi1kTyYMQ7kNvwHFyaSe&_nc_oc=Adq4-a-PdT0GXZolUX0AS8KpgSVuRP3WQtsDBNYlWdLlBRC3WHe0zBCioJF4ncDJ1zI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB0-IquqEsS2ShEy8NXvoegXGAKD4M_5dPrfYf-4IQWkA&oe=6A688DAD"}, {"file_name": "com.glocksoftware.horrorgame-20260114-111655.png", "id": "911517787897938", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_911517791231271_4588332304987211788_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nCl1INHkMlAQ7kNvwGaZ-AJ&_nc_oc=AdqoHeBmb-G3LgwL8j_7V2KzGq1Z0_WGyblI33c2o31GB2lgpxM9IVUm5DCWsAo2YKk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA9xkPOE-L1FTU7H-5Q0rfHNnQEt1kHmzaN8NzxJvsAhg&oe=6A689E9A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-07-18-14h53m09s181.png", "id": "24523165587385059", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821115_24523165607385057_3752300522125326141_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fHK3SsYRpeMQ7kNvwF_ASuQ&_nc_oc=AdrL_gniOAkRKGa31dMz6_J560rzSMgF6uzqOPc0GE9UTIEU0qQLviZtMM1BUKHez20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCG1DXGkuADXIyM3Gd-4rKtFCtFi4cwOpEmDX5BEk7k5A&oe=6A68B140"}, "display_name": "Forgotten Possessions", "keywords": ["horror", "stealth", "survival", "scary", "psychological"], "long_description": "**They say some things are better left forgotten. In this cabin, they are hunting you.**\n\nForgotten Possessions is a raw, physics-based VR horror experience crafted by a solo developer. No hand-holding. No safety net. Just you, your flashlight, and the crushing weight of the silence.\n\n# WHY YOU WILL FEAR THE DARK:\n\n- **Ever-Changing Nightmare:** Item locations and scares are randomized. Every run is a fresh descent into madness\u2014you never know where the next item hides or where the entity will strike.\n- **The Guardian:** A relentless AI that listens and hunts. It reacts to your noise and tracks your last known position. Silence is your only weapon.\n- **Unravel the Truth:** Explore the cabin to find hidden collectibles and piece together a dark, forgotten history. Each run reveals more of the story.\n- **Scoring Mode:** Beat your high score and test your stealth and survival skills in a franatical collecting run!\n\n# PLANNED FEATURES FOR FULL RELEASE (NOT GUARANTEED)\n\n- **Difficulty Modifiers or Difficulty Selection:** A new mode where the AI gets stronger as you progress OR a mode where you select AI modifiers yourself. ", "short_description": "Find and collect items that tell a dark story in an abandoned log cabin, but watch out for what lurks behind you. You sneak through dark rooms against a relentless, adaptive creature. Forget combat\u2014patience and stealth are your only mission. Experience a dynamic world with randomized item locations and a reactive environment. Evade the guardian as it reacts to noise and hunts you. Piece by piece, reveal the chilling past and examine items in your personal safe room."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://glock-software.de/privacy.html", "developer_terms_o